{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01811","headline":"杂曲歌辞 古别离二首 一 · 于濆","name":"杂曲歌辞 古别离二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入室少情意，出门多路岐。\n黄鹤有归日，荡子无还时。\n人谁无分命，妾身何太奇。\n君爲东南风，妾作西北枝。\n青楼邻里妇，终年画长眉。\n自倚对良匹，笑妾空罗帏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}